{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/Gameplay_title.png?t=1752664949\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/Crime.gif?t=1752664949\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start by cleaning streets for spare cash\u2014but that won\u2019t be enough. To get ahead, you\u2019ll need to <strong>lie, steal, gamble, or scam</strong> your way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've made your first fortune, <strong>build your scam empire</strong>\u2014set up a scam centre, post fake ads, and trick your victims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/extras/Mange.gif?t=1752664949\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your workers</strong> and decide: treat them fairly, or squeeze them for every dollar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this town, only the cunning survive.<br><strong>Will you rise\u2014or fall under your own schemes?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484850?t=1752664949","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/a4bfdbca897c67eda92c742aa1ad839e84a5b76d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752664949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/88b84accdaa457f1d19df910c01b92b9a15890f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752664949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484850/88b84accdaa457f1d19df910c01b92b9a15890f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752664949","categories":[{"description":"S